Step 6: Query, Key, Value

Every token creates 3 vectors:

Query
Key
Value

Example:

Token: Prometheus

Query = [0.1 0.5]
Key   = [0.2 0.3]
Value = [0.8 0.9]
Why?

Suppose current token is:

it

Query asks:

Who am I related to?

Every previous word exposes a Key.

Similarity:

Query • Key

(dot product)

Higher score:

More attention
