Step 7: Self-Attention in PyTorch
import torch

x = torch.rand(3,4)

Q = x
K = x
V = x

scores = Q @ K.T

weights = torch.softmax(scores, dim=-1)

output = weights @ V

print(output)

This is the core idea.

Real GPT just learns Q,K,V.

