Repeat millions of times.

Step 12: Why GPT Becomes Smart

GPT does NOT memorize answers.

During training it repeatedly solves:

Predict next token
Predict next token
Predict next token
...

Trillions of times.

Eventually it learns:

Grammar
Relationships
Coding patterns
Kubernetes concepts
Terraform syntax
Human reasoning patterns

all as a side effect of next-token prediction.

