The difference between your tiny GPT and models like ChatGPT is mostly:

Model	Parameters
Tiny GPT	~10K
Small GPT	~1M
Medium GPT	~100M
Modern LLM	Billions/Trillions

The architecture is fundamentally the same.

A very good next step is to build a 100-line character-level GPT in PyTorch, train it on Kubernetes/Prometheus notes, and then inspect every tensor (Q, K, V, attention scores, embeddings) during training. That's usually the moment when transformers "click" conceptually.